{"page":20090,"part":1,"text":"学真草书\n\n自此已后，只日学草书，双日学真书。真书兼行，草书兼楷，十年不倦当得名。然虚名已得，而真气耗矣，万事莫不皆然。有以寓其意，不知身之为劳也；有以乐其心，不知物之为累也。然则自古无不累心之物，而有为物所乐之心。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20090,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"38d6c11a76bd352a2bdc49abf364ccd14ce31177abc44de155d30b4f9081d1a2","textSha256":"38d6c11a76bd352a2bdc49abf364ccd14ce31177abc44de155d30b4f9081d1a2","fileSha256":"38d6c11a76bd352a2bdc49abf364ccd14ce31177abc44de155d30b4f9081d1a2","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20090-work-105.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"试笔 · 学真草书","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"b16c0e74766029878f2c01942fd06cb7e2b7134c7ca3816856282bc588302233","id":"m4WYW9zcK3k1upH3LGDwsE","page_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","root_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","work":"试笔","author":"欧阳修","type":"tinyHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":4},{"start":6,"end":108,"sourceTextSha256":"385c980f4e9a3b51be453e3d41f6c34b9fba3b63e603433908f6456d0feb2527","id":"r8ZBzjaMGf4zJU3RXDzH3","page_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","root_id":"TApXP9wfa4NHrhzheeU8G","work":"试笔","author":"欧阳修","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":102}]},"segments":[{"start":0,"end":4,"quote":"学真草书","role":"structure","category":"篇章标题","note":"来源原有标题","contextStatus":"complete"},{"start":4,"end":6,"quote":"\n\n","role":"structure","category":"段落分隔","note":"展示分隔，不替代来源字符","contextStatus":"complete"},{"start":6,"end":108,"quote":"自此已后，只日学草书，双日学真书。真书兼行，草书兼楷，十年不倦当得名。然虚名已得，而真气耗矣，万事莫不皆然。有以寓其意，不知身之为劳也；有以乐其心，不知物之为累也。然则自古无不累心之物，而有为物所乐之心。","role":"theory","category":"学书方法","note":"安排真草兼学，反思寓意与劳心","contextStatus":"complete"}],"candidates":[{"id":"W20090-0001","start":6,"end":108,"quo